{{Blockquote|I, (name), do swear in the name of God (or, solemnly affirm) that I will faithfully execute the office of President of India, and will do the best of my ability preserve, protect and defend the [[Constitution of India|Constitution]] and the [[Law of India|law]], and that I will devote myself to the service and well-being of the people of Republic of India.
